(ratio {{ "%.2f" | format(fs.loc['Male', 'calibration_ratio']) }}) and of 18-24s ({{ "%.2f" | format(fa.loc['18-24', 'calibration_ratio']) }}). Adding employment status (which contains a "retired" category) does not fix this,
so it stays excluded. These are screens that trigger a Compliance review, not legal conclusions; Compliance must confirm which remedies are lawful in the relevant jurisdiction.</p>
